ection":"chapter-043","block":"b-962c82ad79e50c7a0854","layer":"original","quote":"成都既定，先主领益州牧，以恢为功曹书佐、主簿","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":57,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":22,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huowang-q-225ed2d7e9d667049592","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-20cf9e4bd23391868d15","layer":"original","quote":"成都既定，先主领益州牧，以诗为督军从事","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":169,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":34,"end":53,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o043c-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-4a221026fdb893201c62","layer":"original","quote":"先主复领益州牧：诸葛亮为股肱〖2〗，法正为谋主，关羽、张飞、马超为爪牙〖3〗，许靖、麋竺、简雍为宾友〖4〗。及董和、黄权、李严等〖5〗，本璋之所授用也，吴壹、费观等〖6〗，又璋之婚亲也；彭羕〖7〗，又璋之所排摈也；刘巴者〖8〗，宿昔之所忌恨也：皆处之显任，尽其器能。有志之士，无不竞劝。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":186,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":63,"end":206,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-b-dcc10490c7b3b72c467f","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-dcc10490c7b3b72c467f","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十九年：建安十九年（公元 214）。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":188,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-dc65792cc6043766510a","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o043","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-4a221026fdb893201c62","layer":"original","quote":"十九年夏〖1〗，雒城破；﹝一﹞进围成都，数十日，璋出降。﹝二﹞蜀中殷盛丰乐，先主置酒大飨士卒；取蜀城中金银分赐将士，还其谷帛。先主复领益州牧：诸葛亮为股肱〖2〗，法正为谋主，关羽、张飞、马超为爪牙〖3〗，许靖、麋竺、简雍为宾友〖4〗。及董和、黄权、李严等〖5〗，本璋之所授用也，吴壹、费观等〖6〗，又璋之婚亲也；彭羕〖7〗，又璋之所排摈也；刘巴者〖8〗，宿昔之所忌恨也：皆处之显任，尽其器能。有志之士，无不竞劝。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":186,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":206,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xumisun-q-9d9c6c3cd013f113898d","section":"chapter-038","block":"b-4724e70f37115927f07b","layer":"original","quote":"先主克蜀，以靖为左将军长史","section_title":"许麋孙简伊秦传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0082.xhtml","index":148,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":7,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
